cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use qiskit-omelyan, please cite the paper below as well as the software."
type: software
title: "qiskit-omelyan"
version: "1.0.1"
abstract: >-
  Omelyan-type (and related) symmetric product formulas for Hamiltonian time evolution in Qiskit.
  Provides a general ramp-based construction, OmelyanTrotter, which implements symmetric product formulas
  of any even order and number of cycles, with optional merging of single-qubit rotations and of
  consecutive steps to reduce the gate count. It includes a collection of optimised schemes from the
  literature (Leapfrog, Omelyan, Forest-Ruth, Yoshida, Blanes-Moan and Morales) and the efficient schemes
  of Maležič and Ostmeyer at orders 4, 6 and 8, and registers a HighLevelSynthesis plugin
  (omelyan_trotter) for PauliEvolutionGate, so the schemes can be used directly in Qiskit's transpiler.
  The construction is described in arXiv:2602.21145, and the schemes and their application to noisy
  quantum circuits in arXiv:2601.18756 and arXiv:2611.27896.
